rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T12:37:58Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T12:37:58Z","body":"Yeah this is not really a regression, but a behavior change. The LineEdit is still usable.\nI think adding `keep_editing_on_text_submitted` to easily preserve the old behavior makes sense.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531524713/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531553874","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100230#issuecomment-2531553874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100230","id":2531553874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W5HJS","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T12:51:40Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T12:59:58Z","body":"> Yeah this is not really a regression, but a behavior change. The LineEdit is still usable. I think adding `keep_editing_on_text_submitted` to easily preserve the old behavior makes sense.\n\nTo avoid setting it to true for all the `LineEdit` nodes in editor, i have defaulted it to false for game (to avoid causing regression) and to true for editor and editor plugins.\n\nbut I think it should be true by default for both since it only cause regression for console like input fields, check this https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97088.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531553874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2534957476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100230#issuecomment-2534957476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100230","id":2534957476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XGGGk","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T08:29:43Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T08:29:43Z","body":"> This feature was added to prevent the focus loss of the `LineEdit` when pressing `Escape` button, a workaround for now is to use `LineEdit.edit().call_deferred()` when text is submitted, and also i can add a variable `keep_editing_on_text_submitted`.\n\nNot quite sure I understand -- the issue happens even if there's no callbacks for the lineedit.  You can just throw one in a scene and press enter and it loses focus.  Also, is the losing of focus on enter necessary to stop losing focus on escape?  Guess I don't fully understand the intent here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2534957476/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]